[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":92},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","xhhd6opij65c78hueblhmsy08","revision",1,"title","亚马逊零售套利转向线上自动化","originalTitle","If your Amazon business requires scanning barcodes in retail aisles every weekend, you built yourself a weekend shift.","summary","如果你的亚马逊业务需要每个周末在零售货架上扫描条形码，那你就是给自己排了个周末班。\n\n拿着手机扫描仪跑遍 Target 或 Walmart 确实能建立不错的利润空间，但真正的运营规模来自于线上采购、自动化的 Keepa 筛选器以及无论你是否进店都能运行的补货系统。\n\n能够离开商店货架而销售不中断，这才是重点所在。","reason","source",{"_9":85,"_86":87,"_88":89,"_90":39,"_91":-5},"links",{"_82":83,"_66":84},"publishedAt","2026-10-05T12:00:51.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T16:14:18.338Z","timelineAt","category","advertising","tags",[80,81],"score",18,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","askjimmysmith","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>If your Amazon business requires scanning barcodes in retail aisles every weekend, you built yourself a weekend shift.</p><p>Running through Target or Walmart with a phone scanner works to build some great profit margins, but real operational scale comes from online sourcing, automated Keepa filters, and replen systems that run whether you step foot in a store or not.</p><p>Being able to step away from store aisles without sales stopping is the whole point.</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Jimmy Smith","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[],"广告/运营","卖家工具","aihot","/items/xhhd6opij65c78hueblhmsy08","https://x.com/askjimmysmith/status/2107078563740488151","x-jimmy-smith","name","X · Jimmy Smith","kind","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_93":94},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
